@base = http://localhost:4000

### Créer un jeu
# @name catan
POST {{base}}/board-games
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Catan", "minPlayers": 3, "maxPlayers": 4, "description": "Colons et moutons" }

### Créer un jeu sans description
POST {{base}}/board-games
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Azul", "minPlayers": 2, "maxPlayers": 4 }

### Lister les jeux
GET {{base}}/board-games

### Récupérer le jeu créé
GET {{base}}/board-games/{{catan.response.body.id}}

### Modifier seulement le nombre max de joueurs
PATCH {{base}}/board-games/{{catan.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "maxPlayers": 6 }

### Effacer la description
PATCH {{base}}/board-games/{{catan.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "description": null }

### PATCH minPlayers au-dessus du maxPlayers existant (6) → 400
PATCH {{base}}/board-games/{{catan.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "minPlayers": 7 }

### Supprimer le jeu → 204
DELETE {{base}}/board-games/{{catan.response.body.id}}

### --- Cas d'erreur ---

### maxPlayers < minPlayers → 400
POST {{base}}/board-games
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Bug", "minPlayers": 4, "maxPlayers": 2 }

### Champ manquant → 400
POST {{base}}/board-games
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Bug" }

### Supprimer un jeu déjà joué (Catan du seed) → 409
DELETE {{base}}/board-games/1

### Jeu inexistant → 404
GET {{base}}/board-games/999999
